    "created_at": "2026-04-22T12:51:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-22T12:51:25Z",
    "body": "this is a misunderstanding of the `in` expr. `age in [10, 5]` means `age is either 10 or 5`, not `5 <= age <= 10`.",
